1184
00:34:45,618 --> 00:34:46,618
- Oh, do you?

1185
00:34:46,618 --> 00:34:47,980
- Did you hear that?

1186
00:34:47,980 --> 00:34:49,260
- [Man On Phone] We
read you loud and clear.

1187
00:34:49,260 --> 00:34:50,420
- We just don't like you.

1188
00:34:50,420 --> 00:34:52,140
- [Man On Phone] We
have no Colonel Yurulin

1189
