listed on our officers roster.

1190
00:34:53,780 --> 00:34:55,500
- Don't talk nonsense!

1191
00:34:55,500 --> 00:34:57,300
Check that roster again!

1192
00:34:57,300 --> 00:34:59,460
I've been a senior officer
in the Saysar command

1193
00:34:59,460 --> 00:35:01,662
for the last 20 years!

1194
00:35:01,662 --> 00:35:04,224
- Captain, I think there's
some sort of mistake!

1195
00:35:04,224 --> 00:35:05,980
- Starting with the script.

1196
00:35:05,980 --> 00:35:08,060
- Colonel Yurulin, it sounds
like you're pretending

1197
00:35:08,060 --> 00:35:09,822
to be someone you aren't!

1198
00:35:09,822 --> 00:35:10,940
- Nobody asked you.

1199
00:35:10,940 --> 00:35:12,864
This insubordination is unheard of!

1200
00:35:12,864 --> 00:35:15,224
- Three weeks' detention for Ken!

1201
00:35:15,224 --> 00:35:17,224
- Well you did reveal a
few vital military secrets

1202
00:35:17,224 --> 00:35:19,264
to the Karans, didn't you?

1203
00:35:19,264 --> 00:35:20,264
- Wait a second.

1204
00:35:20,264 --> 00:35:22,064
You're saying I gave
away vital information?

1205
00:35:22,064 --> 00:35:23,344
- Yeah.

1206
00:35:23,344 --> 00:35:25,304
- How did you find out about that?

1207
00:35:25,304 --> 00:35:26,424
(gulping sounds)

1208
00:35:26,424 --> 00:35:27,424
- I got drunk.

1209
00:35:27,424 --> 00:35:28,257
(exhales)

1210
00:35:28,257 --> 00:35:29,154
- Anyway, now it seems we're all involved

1211
00:35:29,154 --> 00:35:30,114
in this situation together.

1212
00:35:30,114 --> 00:35:31,634
- Yep.

1213
00:35:31,634 --> 00:35:32,954
- This is no trade mission.

1214
00:35:32,954 --> 00:35:34,396
You're after that secret
weapon, aren't you?

1215
00:35:34,396 --> 00:35:35,396
- Colonel Yurulin.

1216
00:35:35,396 --> 00:35:36,996
- Your mouthwash just ain't making it.

1217
00:35:36,996 --> 00:35:39,396
- If we are after it, then I think you're

1218
00:35:39,396 --> 00:35:42,336
