Captain Joe's in the bucket,

2693
01:26:26,461 --> 01:26:27,341
you know.

2694
01:26:27,341 --> 01:26:28,461
- Yep, yep.

2695
01:26:28,461 --> 01:26:29,661
- He's had a few.

2696
01:26:29,661 --> 01:26:31,621
- It's the opening of Manix.

2697
01:26:31,621 --> 01:26:32,454
- Sorry.

2698
01:26:34,541 --> 01:26:36,874
