2712
01:27:14,465 --> 01:27:16,065
We can be allies!

2713
01:27:16,065 --> 01:27:18,148
(grunts)

2714
01:27:20,062 --> 01:27:20,895
- My nut!

2715
01:27:20,895 --> 01:27:22,245
- Oh!

2716
01:27:22,245 --> 01:27:24,445
(grunts)

2717
01:27:24,445 --> 01:27:26,285
- Big mistake.

2718
01:27:26,285 --> 01:27:27,925
- You're dumber than I thought, Ken.

2719
01:27:27,925 --> 01:27:30,885
