2728
01:27:45,245 --> 01:27:48,752
- But I'm an incredible simulation.

2729
01:27:48,752 --> 01:27:49,969
- Don't die!

2730
01:27:49,969 --> 01:27:50,802
- Ken!

2731
01:27:53,129 --> 01:27:54,129
- Hey, neat!

2732
01:27:54,129 --> 01:27:55,889
Where did you get the girl on a stick?

2733
01:27:55,889 --> 01:27:57,609
- This must be Halkon's work.

2734
01:27:57,609 --> 01:28:00,009
