detail, the craftsmanship.

2735
01:28:00,009 --> 01:28:02,089
- Look, Halkon's getting away.

2736
01:28:02,089 --> 01:28:03,529
- No!

2737
01:28:03,529 --> 01:28:04,689
- Yes!

2738
01:28:04,689 --> 01:28:06,249
- No, he's not!

2739
01:28:06,249 --> 01:28:08,249
(blast)

2740
01:28:09,134 --> 01:28:10,134
- Super car!

2741
01:28:12,331 --> 01:28:13,164
Super car!

2742
01:28:14,091 --> 01:28:15,251
- This is it!

2743
01:28:15,251 --> 01:28:16,531
