2748
01:28:27,051 --> 01:28:30,131
I'm under a table, I'm running cam B.

2749
01:28:30,131 --> 01:28:32,611
- Um no, that was George Bernard Shaw.

2750
01:28:32,611 --> 01:28:33,444
- Baghdad?

2751
01:28:34,411 --> 01:28:38,371
- So uh, why do you think they're fighting

2752
01:28:38,371 --> 01:28:40,533
