2753
01:28:40,533 --> 01:28:41,533
(gasps)

2754
01:28:41,533 --> 01:28:43,653
- He's gotta go bad, that one.

2755
01:28:43,653 --> 01:28:46,293
- Puppet ships to the rescue!

2756
01:28:46,293 --> 01:28:48,293
