2761
01:29:00,515 --> 01:29:02,395
- Yeah, that's it.

2762
01:29:02,395 --> 01:29:03,395
Pretty much.

2763
01:29:04,995 --> 01:29:05,995
- Attack.

2764
01:29:05,995 --> 01:29:09,828
- Oh, he's urging himself
on, self motivation.

2765
01:29:11,557 --> 01:29:12,677
- Now die!

2766
01:29:12,677 --> 01:29:14,010
- You die, Joel!

2767
01:29:20,397 --> 01:29:23,037
- You'll never destroy me, Star Wolf!

2768
01:29:23,037 --> 01:29:25,317
- You can't destroy me, I quit!

2769
01:29:25,317 --> 01:29:26,877
