2778
01:29:44,319 --> 01:29:45,319
(giggles)

2779
01:29:45,319 --> 01:29:46,319
- Yeah.

2780
01:29:46,319 --> 01:29:47,599
- 'Cause they have dentists there.

2781
01:29:47,599 --> 01:29:49,079
