2807
01:30:38,121 --> 01:30:39,637
Maybe hire some staff, I don't know.

2808
01:30:39,637 --> 01:30:41,617
- Valna's missionaries, and died there.

2809
01:30:41,617 --> 01:30:43,697
I want to finish the work.

2810
01:30:43,697 --> 01:30:45,577
- Hmm, it's not exactly on our way.

2811
01:30:45,577 --> 01:30:47,419
- It's your decision.

2812
01:30:47,419 --> 01:30:49,579
- Boy, his cheeks are huge.

2813
01:30:49,579 --> 01:30:50,899
- Good luck, Ken.

2814
01:30:50,899 --> 01:30:52,099
Star Wolf.

2815
01:30:52,099 --> 01:30:53,516
- Thank, I think.

2816
01:30:55,779 --> 01:30:57,339
