2821
01:31:08,339 --> 01:31:09,379
- It's been great.

2822
01:31:09,379 --> 01:31:10,539
- Thanks.

2823
01:31:10,539 --> 01:31:11,579
- Dan?

2824
01:31:11,579 --> 01:31:13,581
- Or, whatever your name is, new guy.

2825
01:31:13,581 --> 01:31:14,581
Think I would've liked you.

2826
01:31:14,581 --> 01:31:15,781
- We've been through a lot together.

2827
01:31:15,781 --> 01:31:16,781
- Yeah.

2828
01:31:16,781 --> 01:31:18,261
- Soul brother.

2829
01:31:18,261 --> 01:31:19,094
- Tammy?

2830
01:31:20,141 --> 01:31:21,821
I'll never forget you.

2831
01:31:21,821 --> 01:31:25,238
