2832
01:31:26,261 --> 01:31:27,761
- Ooh, doll hands.

2833
01:31:28,741 --> 01:31:29,741
(gasps)

2834
01:31:29,741 --> 01:31:31,621
- Oh, grow up.

2835
01:31:31,621 --> 01:31:34,461
- Hey, they're gonna
land on the bowling ball.

2836
01:31:34,461 --> 01:31:37,141
(beeps)

2837
01:31:37,141 --> 01:31:38,861
- Ready now, take off!

2838
01:31:38,861 --> 01:31:40,101
- Take off, Hoser!

2839
01:31:40,101 --> 01:31:41,101
(exclaims)

2840
01:31:41,101 --> 01:31:41,934
- Woah!

2841
01:31:49,833 --> 01:31:50,833
- Star Wolf.

2842
01:31:52,197 --> 01:31:53,447
- Goodbye, Ken.

2843
01:31:54,997 --> 01:31:56,557
- Good night, sweet prince.

2844
01:31:56,557 --> 01:31:57,557
- Oh, look at that suit,

2845
01:31:57,557 --> 01:32:01,729
what is he going to be, in
swing choir or something?

2846
01:32:01,729 --> 01:32:03,219
- And we have closure!

2847
01:32:03,219 --> 01:32:05,302
(cheers)

2848
01:32:06,784 --> 01:32:07,863
- [Voiceover] Fugitive Alien will be back

2849
01:32:07,863 --> 01:32:09,703
