2854
01:32:31,545 --> 01:32:32,545
- Oh no, no, no.

2855
01:32:32,545 --> 01:32:33,945
I couldn't handle
Brian's song again, Crow.

2856
01:32:33,945 --> 01:32:36,225
When I saw that I was
dewy-eyed for a week.

2857
01:32:36,225 --> 01:32:37,865
- No, it didn't affect me that way at all.

2858
01:32:37,865 --> 01:32:39,385
- Well you know I had
some other things going

2859
01:32:39,385 --> 01:32:40,585
