2867
01:32:52,067 --> 01:32:53,507
(barking)

2868
01:32:53,507 --> 01:32:55,027
And maybe all our interests
can be served, gang.

2869
01:32:55,027 --> 01:32:56,387
It can be a win-win situation.

2870
01:32:56,387 --> 01:32:57,707
- Yeah.

2871
01:32:57,707 --> 01:32:59,187
- I don't know about that, the MADs seem

2872
01:32:59,187 --> 01:33:01,627
