2899
01:33:50,991 --> 01:33:54,511
Richard Nixon, Richard the
Third, and Keith Richards!

2900
01:33:54,511 --> 01:33:56,271
You know, but according to the fellowship

2901
01:33:56,271 --> 01:33:57,751
