2902
01:33:57,751 --> 01:33:58,991
was actually a fine man--

2903
01:33:58,991 --> 01:34:02,391
- I don't even think of
Keith Richards as that evil.

2904
01:34:02,391 --> 01:34:04,071
- Oh, but he's so scary!

2905
01:34:04,071 --> 01:34:07,273
- Richard Baseheart, Richard Baseheart,

2906
01:34:07,273 --> 01:34:08,553
and Richard Baseheart!

2907
01:34:08,553 --> 01:34:12,353
- But Gypsy, you like Richard Baseheart.

2908
01:34:12,353 --> 01:34:13,186
- Oh.

2909
01:34:15,080 --> 01:34:18,915
- How about Howie Mandel,
David Brenner and Gallagher?

2910
01:34:18,915 --> 01:34:21,215
- Or David Brenner, Andy
Rooney, David Brenner,

2911
01:34:21,215 --> 01:34:22,335
