2912
01:34:22,335 --> 01:34:23,775
- Ooh, that one stung.

2913
01:34:23,775 --> 01:34:26,615
- Personally, I hate Mondays.

2914
01:34:26,615 --> 01:34:28,575
- Yeah, I know what you mean.

2915
01:34:28,575 --> 01:34:31,255
Anyway, I think we need
something kind of uplifting,

2916
01:34:31,255 --> 01:34:33,695
so I brought along these letters here.

2917
01:34:33,695 --> 01:34:38,095
This first one, let's put
that on still-store cambot.

2918
01:34:38,095 --> 01:34:41,055
This first one comes from an Eddie Hogan

2919
01:34:41,055 --> 01:34:42,135
