2933
01:35:16,297 --> 01:35:19,337
(slowly laughs)

2934
01:35:19,337 --> 01:35:20,337
- That's nice.

2935
01:35:20,337 --> 01:35:22,057
- Let's get another one, that one's not--

2936
01:35:22,057 --> 01:35:25,537
- That was really uplifting,
Joel, I gotta tell ya.

2937
01:35:25,537 --> 01:35:26,751
- This one seems happier,
let's put this one

2938
01:35:26,751 --> 01:35:27,831
one still-story.

2939
01:35:27,831 --> 01:35:29,551
Eddie, you might wanna get into breakfast.

2940
01:35:29,551 --> 01:35:32,231
